  "name": "kimi-k2.5",
  "displayName": "Kimi K2.5",
  "provider": "Moonshot",
  "description": "Kimi-K2.5 is a large language model from Moonshot AI, distinguished by its industry-leading 2 million token context window. It can process entire books, large codebases, and lengthy documents in a single pass, with enhanced long-horizon code generation and multimodal input support.",
  "zhDescription": "月之暗面（Moonshot AI）的大语言模型，以其业界领先的200万token上下文窗口而著称。这种卓越的长上下文能力使得可以在单次推理中处理整本书、庞大的代码库、冗长的法律文件和全面的研究论文。即使在上下文范围的极端情况下，该模型也能保持高准确性和连贯性，对于文档分析、长文本内容生成和需要大量背景信息的复杂多步推理任务具有极高价值。",
  "longDescription": "Kimi-K2.5 is a large language model from Moonshot AI, distinguished by its industry-leading 2 million token context window. It can process entire books, large codebases, and lengthy documents in a single pass, with enhanced long-horizon code generation and multimodal input support.",
